# Cloudflare Pages redirects — kidtoycn.com
#
# These are SAME-DOMAIN 301s, which Cloudflare Pages does support.
# (Cross-subdomain redirects in this file do NOT work — that is why the
#  www.kidtoycn.com 403 is handled by a Cloudflare Page Rule instead.)
#
# Context: this domain was migrated off Shopify in Aug 2026. GSC reports 39
# legacy URLs as 404 (First detected 8/22/26). These rules recover the ones
# that have a genuine new equivalent page.
#
# Deliberately NOT done: blanket "everything unknown -> /" catch-alls. Google
# treats unrelated redirects as soft 404s, which is worse hygiene than a real
# 404. Only 1:1 equivalent mappings are listed here.
#
# RULE ORDER MATTERS — Cloudflare Pages uses the FIRST matching rule.
# Syntax:  <from>  <to>  <status>

# --- Shopify language prefix /zh/ ( "/zh/X" is the Chinese version of "/X" ) ---
/zh/                       /                          301
/zh/products/*             /products/:splat/          301
/zh/collections/*          /collections/:splat/       301
/zh/about                  /about/                    301
/zh/faq                    /faq/                      301
/zh/contact                /contact/                  301
/zh/refund                 /refund/                   301
/zh/shipping               /shipping/                 301
/zh/*                      /:splat                    301

# --- Shopify “page” type (/pages/<handle>) ---
/pages/about-us            /about/                    301
/pages/about               /about/                    301
/pages/faq                 /faq/                      301
/pages/contact             /contact/                  301
/pages/contact-us          /contact/                  301
/pages/refund-policy       /refund/                   301
/pages/shipping-policy     /shipping/                 301

# --- Shopify policy paths (/policies/<handle>) ---
/policies/refund-policy    /refund/                   301
/policies/shipping-policy  /shipping/                 301
# NOTE: /policies/terms-of-service and /policies/privacy-policy have NO
# equivalent page on this site (there is no /terms/ or /privacy/ — both 404).
# They are intentionally left to 404 until those pages exist. Adding the pages
# is a content task, tracked in 3-site-roadmap.md.

# /products/ has no index page; the catalogue lives at /collections/all
/products/                 /collections/all/          301
/products                  /collections/all/          301
